    featuredImagePrompt: "A realistic, high-fidelity image of a modern, well-lit medical research laboratory. On the left, a scientist (diverse ethnicity, late 30s) in a lab coat is interacting with a transparent, holographic display projecting detailed AI-driven medical data, such as a 3D liver scan with highlighted tumor regions or personalized genetic sequences. On the right, another scientist (diverse ethnicity, late 40s) is meticulously examining cell cultures under an advanced microscope, with intricate petri dishes and biological samples visible on the workbench, suggesting research into senescent cells. The background features sleek, futuristic lab equipment and subtle glowing screens, conveying cutting-edge innovation and collaboration. The overall composition should be clean, professional, and visually engaging, representing the synergy between AI and biological research.",
