    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a somber and serious tone. The main focus is a blurred, dramatic image of mangled high-speed train carriages against a dark, cloudy sky near Madrid. Overlaying this, incorporate subtle graphical elements like a broken signal light or a schematic representation of a train track with a red 'X' mark. The overall composition should be impactful, conveying tragedy and urgent investigation, suitable for a major news report. Avoid any visible human suffering. Dominant colors are muted greys, dark blues, and subtle reds, reflecting the gravity of the situation. Ensure a unique perspective, not a generic accident scene, perhaps a low-angle shot emphasizing the scale of the destruction.",
