    socialHeadlines: ["Big news for crypto holders! The IRS is making tax compliance easier. But beware, a major blockchain just got hacked. 🚨 #CryptoNews #IRS #BlockchainSecurity", "Initia blockchain exploit: $2.6M drained. Meanwhile, the SEC flags \'tokenization\' as high-risk. What does this mean for your digital assets? #Crypto #SEC #Exploit", "Tax relief, security breaches, and new regulatory warnings. The crypto market is buzzing! Get the full breakdown. #DigitalAssets #Fintech", "Navigating the wild west of crypto: IRS offers tax flexibility, but new hacks and SEC warnings mean vigilance is key. #CryptoRegulation #InvestorAlert", "From tax breaks to hacks: A critical look at the latest in crypto. Is tokenization the next big risk? #CryptoMarket #PulseTrends"],
