      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A neutral-to-bearish outlook appears most likely in the short-to-medium term. While Ledger\'s core technology may be sound, the trust deficit from a physical compromise is significant. There\'s a high probability of a shift in user behavior towards more secure purchasing habits and potentially an acceleration of interest in regulated custodial solutions. Long-term recovery for Ledger hinges on transparent remediation and verifiable security enhancements.",
