    opportunities: ["Continued expansion of value-based care models.", "Further integration and monetization of AI and data analytics.", "Growth in global healthcare markets, including emerging economies.", "Strategic acquisitions to expand service offerings and market share.", "Leveraging Optum\'s diverse services to drive integrated care solutions."],
    outlook: "UnitedHealth Group\'s future outlook appears robust, anchored by its raised 2026 earnings guidance. The company is poised to continue leveraging its scale, technological investments (especially in AI), and focus on value-based care to drive sustainable growth. While the broader economic environment and regulatory landscape will remain key variables, UNH\'s proactive strategies for cost management and innovation position it favorably. The positive sentiment generated by these results could also help stabilize investor confidence in the healthcare sector, even amidst global economic uncertainties.",
