      neutralCase: "The crypto market is in a phase of complex transition. While institutional interest and stablecoin potential offer long-term promise, the nuanced volatility profile of Bitcoin and significant barriers to stablecoin adoption (education, fraud) suggest a balanced outlook. Growth will likely be steady but punctuated by periods of uncertainty as the market navigates these challenges and regulatory developments.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "We assign a 50% probability to a \'Neutral\' outlook, reflecting the balanced interplay of bullish and bearish factors. There\'s a 30% probability of a \'Bullish\' scenario if stablecoin education and regulatory clarity accelerate, unlocking APAC potential. A 20% probability of a \'Bearish\' scenario exists if tail risks in Bitcoin become more pronounced or stablecoin adoption barriers prove harder to overcome, leading to prolonged consolidation or minor corrections.",
