      neutralCase: "A neutral perspective anticipates continued market choppiness, with gains and losses balancing out as investors react to mixed economic signals. The tech sector might see continued growth, but other sectors could lag. The Fed may remain data-dependent, leading to a prolonged period of uncertainty regarding interest rates, keeping the market range-bound.",
